Package: qtl2mr
Type: Package
Title: Founder-Aware Mendelian Randomization in Multiparent Mice
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Xiaoyang", family = "Dai",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "xd14188@bristol.ac.uk")
Description: Direct selected-locus founder-aware linear mixed models and
    overlap-aware second-order Mendelian randomization for qtl2-style
    multiparent mouse data. The primary workflow estimates founder-contrast
    exposure and outcome effects, constructs star-space overlap covariance,
    validates joint positive semidefiniteness, and writes audit-ready result
    folders with diagnostics.
